        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ Dive into unpredictable horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under The Floor</strong> is a psychological fear simulator where every playthrough is unique… and every minute could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone in an abandoned house, overrun by hostile entities.<br>Your goal: <strong>survive as long as you can</strong>, then attempt to cleanse the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing plays by the rules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️ No playthrough is ever the same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session generates a different combination of events, sounds, apparitions—even the rules themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you think you’ve learned won’t help you next time.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities behave differently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment turns hostile in new and unexpected ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t learn. You can only survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎧 Run. Hide. Listen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is your instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide</strong> in the shadows.<br><strong>Listen</strong> for signs of movement.<br><strong>Anticipate</strong> what you don’t yet understand.<br>Sometimes, <strong>running</strong> is your only option.<br>And sometimes… <strong>even running won’t be enough.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🩸 A psychological pressure cooker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under The Floor</strong> isn’t just another horror game.<br>It’s a nerve-wracking, unpredictable experience.<br>A true test of your mental endurance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔁 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 <strong>Randomized events, sounds, and rules</strong> each time you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 <strong>Unpredictable entities</strong> that adapt to your behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Constant tension</strong> without cheap jumpscares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚️ <strong>Free exploration</strong> of an increasingly hostile house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>High replayability</strong> — no run is ever the same</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How long will you last before you break?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ Dive into unpredictable horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under The Floor</strong> is a psychological fear simulator where every playthrough is unique… and every minute could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone in an abandoned house, overrun by hostile entities.<br>Your goal: <strong>survive as long as you can</strong>, then attempt to cleanse the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing plays by the rules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️ No playthrough is ever the same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session generates a different combination of events, sounds, apparitions—even the rules themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you think you’ve learned won’t help you next time.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities behave differently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment turns hostile in new and unexpected ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t learn. You can only survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎧 Run. Hide. Listen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is your instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide</strong> in the shadows.<br><strong>Listen</strong> for signs of movement.<br><strong>Anticipate</strong> what you don’t yet understand.<br>Sometimes, <strong>running</strong> is your only option.<br>And sometimes… <strong>even running won’t be enough.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🩸 A psychological pressure cooker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Under The Floor</strong> isn’t just another horror game.<br>It’s a nerve-wracking, unpredictable experience.<br>A true test of your mental endurance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔁 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 <strong>Randomized events, sounds, and rules</strong> each time you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 <strong>Unpredictable entities</strong> that adapt to your behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Constant tension</strong> without cheap jumpscares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚️ <strong>Free exploration</strong> of an increasingly hostile house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>High replayability</strong> — no run is ever the same</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How long will you last before you break?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A psychological horror simulator where every playthrough is unpredictable. Face ever-changing events, sounds, and rules in a haunted house filled with hostile entities. You can't predict. You can't learn. You can only survive… or break.",
